{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_4","type":"agent_message","text":"{\n  \"prompt\": \"Minecraft builder reference sheet, landscape 3:2, crisp vanilla voxel style, plain light background, no characters or animals. Two views side by side at the same scale: LEFT straight-on orthographic front elevation from sidewalk; RIGHT elevated three-quarter view of the same entire long site, showing front and depth and rear garden where visible. Skilled human builder quality: real massing, projecting details, recessed framed openings, real roof verges/eaves/ridge, stairs/slabs/fences/walls/trapdoors/lantern sub-block details. No smooth non-voxel architecture. Site 16 blocks wide x 50 deep, house 14 x 24, about 20 blocks tall, garage base plus 3 storeys. Narrow San Francisco Italianate painted lady squeezed between neighbours on a street climbing east (right in front elevation). Tall teal false front. Dark-teal street base with paired burgundy carriage doors and glass transom. West/left half full-height angled bay, glass on front and both diagonal faces, rising from cream corbels over carriage doors to roofline. East/right half straight cream stairs with white balustrades and two lantern-topped newels up to recessed porch with two cream columns and arch, burgundy door with sidelights/transom and hanging lantern. Horizontal teal siding crossed by gold fish-scale bands at each floor line. Tall narrow windows with cream sills and pointed pediment hoods. Deep cream cornice wrapping bay, burgundy frieze with repeated cream brackets. False-front parapet above with gold panels and small cream pediment concealing low dark-slate gable roof, black iron crest and two brick chimneys on party walls. Tiny front flower garden behind black iron fence beside stairs. Ochre neighbour tight west/downhill, pale-blue neighbour tight east/uphill. Rear gold fish-scale gable above spruce kitchen deck with stairs down into long garden, brick path, flower borders, flowering citrus represented with